<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 1.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, OCT 1.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Oct 1	 Sept 30	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.820     241.300     237.040    1.59 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.070     301.250     303.640   -0.85 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.000     157.900     165.490   -4.53 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.674	46.660	48.410   -3.59 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  376.760     376.900     366.280    2.86 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.870     140.790     147.886   -4.74 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.820	15.804	14.975    5.64 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.670     216.330     230.135   -5.85 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.877	 1.878	 1.939   -3.20 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.555	 1.553	 1.575   -1.27 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  192.090     191.090     206.030   -6.77 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
